1. Added all the necessary provider imports
2. Created instances of required services (QueryClient, i18next)
3. Wrapped the ImportedComponent with all the required providers in the correct order based on the component stack
4. Added Suspense wrapper to handle any lazy loading
5. Provided basic configurations for the providers

This should resolve the provider-related errors. If there are still specific errors related to the actual ImportedComponent functionality, we may need to add more specific error handling or mock certain dependencies.

Note that some of these providers might require additional configuration depending on your specific use case. If you encounter any specific provider-related errors, please let me know and I can help adjust the configuration accordingly.

